# Chips completed (by GM) with no CCB Polymer held: the three chips at Cid play 884; a full inventory filled while 884 is
# open makes its quest:complete fail (not completed again, the chips kept); with room 884 completes it again; then, with
# the polymer held, the trade shows ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (nil).
lists Metalworks/Cid/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/884
char zone=Metalworks pos=-12.6,-11,4
quest Bastok.Chips completed
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
item BoneChip
login
trade Cid BoneChip x1                # completed, the wrong item: nil
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # completed, room, no polymer: 884
fill-inventory
finish                               # the inventory full: the polymer not given, not completed again, the chips kept
free-inventory
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # 884 again
finish                               # completed again: CCB Polymer, San d'Oria +5, Bastok +5, the chips taken
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # the polymer held: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (nil)
